WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.359
Host: Relate the ovarian and endometrial
phases without assuming a fixed calendar.

2
00:00:05.359 --> 00:00:14.751
Guide: Follicular estradiol supports
endometrial proliferation. A sustained
estradiol rise can trigger an LH surge and

3
00:00:14.751 --> 00:00:25.449
Guide: ovulation. Luteal progesterone supports
secretory endometrium; falling luteal hormones
contribute to menstruation when pregnancy does

4
00:00:25.449 --> 00:00:28.338
Guide: not maintain the corpus luteum.

5
00:00:28.338 --> 00:00:35.766
Host: After ovulation, which hormone most
directly supports secretory differentiation of
the endometrium?

6
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:45.234
Guide: Progesterone from the corpus luteum.
Luteal progesterone supports secretory changes
following estradiol-driven proliferation.
